      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "现有页面布局基线 · 系统默认字号 · 浅色 / 深色 · 内容均可编辑；个人、企业、金额均为布局示例。",
      "originalText": "现有页面布局基线 · 系统默认字号 · 浅色 / 深色 · 内容均可编辑；个人、企业、金额均为布局示例。",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "f353fde775d34517b6ed",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 88,
      "width": 508.0,
      "height": 17.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748B",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
